0ahUKEwiNkofHvtKWAxXBePUHHe3uAu4Q3IcHCNUBKBE",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["第一次來吃這間拉麵覺得蠻驚喜！門口大家都乖乖排隊等位！有看板寫預計等候時間30分鐘！（其實沒有等那麼久）一樓服務員小姐姐會詢問要常溫水還是檸檬水👍👍👍\n\n這次點的是 鹽味雞湯麵（有肉）再加一份海苔。肉不是叉燒哦！是很像舒肥的雞肉、可以免費加面或是加湯，還可以依照口味調整鹹淡\n\n湯頭是那種 清澈但非常有層次的雞湯，喝起來很順口，不是那種死鹹的拉麵湯，反而會讓人一口接一口想繼續喝。\n\n麵條選 軟麵，吸附湯汁之後口感很好，搭配嫩雞肉片跟洋蔥碎，味道更有層次。旁邊的海苔也很加分，泡在湯裡或包著麵一起吃都很香。\n\n店內是 吧台式座位，可以直接看到廚房現場煮麵，熱氣蒸騰很有日本拉麵店的氛圍（煮麵條剩下幾分鐘幾秒店員都會附誦一次、蠻可愛的）\n環境乾淨、節奏也很俐落。\n\n店家還有貼小提醒：\n建議先吃麵最後再喝湯，這樣口味剛剛好，不會太鹹，覺得很貼心。\n\n整體吃完覺得\n湯頭清爽、配料用心、氣氛舒服，會讓人想再回訪的一家拉麵店 🍜🤗",null,[0,137]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3TmxSSFNsUlphM0JIVkd4d2MySXdWa3BUZWxKQ1ZYcGtVVlV6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3TmxSSFNsUlphM0JIVkd4d2MySXdWa3BUZWxKQ1ZYcGtVVlV6WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3TmxSSFNsUlphM0JIVkd4d2MySXdWa3BUZWxKQ1ZYcGtVVlV6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3TmxSSFNsUlphM0JIVkd4d2MySXdWa3BUZWxKQ1ZYcGtVVlV6WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3TmxSSFNsUlphM0JIVkd4d2MySXdWa3BUZWxKQ1ZYcGtVVlV6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17118813351812930306/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnR3TmxSSFNsUlphM0JIVkd4d2MySXdWa3BUZWxKQ1ZYcGtVVlV6WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,5042,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twNlRHSlRZa3BHVGxwc2IwVkpTelJCVXpkUVUzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x10c98e45c03aec63!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkp6TGJTYkpGTlpsb0VJSzRBUzdQU3c%7C%7C